{"id":"1b2b007156524813","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-free-variable.md","title":"Free variables (legacy)","display":"df-free-variable — Free variables (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-free-variable","aliases":["27-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — Free variables (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — Free variables (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{ct}\">\\(S,\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{ct}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a> 及其内建项上游。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>。常量、函数符号、关系符号及相应项列的范围在各递归分支局部给定，允许相关签名分量为空。</li>\n<li>引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var})\">\\(\\mathrm{var}:\\mathrm{Term}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var})\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var})\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{var}(\\mathrm{ct}(c))\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{var}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{var}(\\mathrm{ct}(c))\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}(S)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_m))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^m\\mathrm{var}(t_i)\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{var}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_m))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^m\\mathrm{var}(t_i)\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_m(S),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(t\\doteq u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{var}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(t\\doteq u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{var}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_m))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^m\\mathrm{var}(t_i)\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(R(t_1,\\ldots,t_m))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i=1}^m\\mathrm{var}(t_i)\\quad(m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_m(S),\\ (t_1,\\ldots,t_m)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(Qx\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}(Qx\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>已读 57-df-var-in-term 的三分支签名，本次将实际需要的项变量递归局部展开。联结词/量词范围不再只藏在 Remark；有限 AST 上两种结构递归均良定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-formul